  "resolution_html": "<p>Follow the instructions in this document for <a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/faculty-and-staff-services/quick-start-instructions-for-listserv-owners/#remove\">removing a subscriber</a> and then <a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/faculty-and-staff-services/quick-start-instructions-for-listserv-owners/#add_sub\">adding a subscriber</a></p>\n<p><strong>OR</strong></p>\n<p>Using the <strong>Web interface</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"http://listserv.yorku.ca\"><u>http://listserv.yorku.ca</u></a></li>\n<li>Open List Management and select Subscriber Management</li>\n<li>Select the list from drop down menu</li>\n<li>In the box under the Search for Subscribers enter the email address or name of subscriber and click search</li>\n<li>Can either change setting and click Update Settings or Delete to delete from list</li>\n</ol>",
